---
title: "middleware - Request Routing and Session Protection (AttendanceZen: Blueprint)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_kiosk: request.pathname starts with /kiosk?
    q_check_kiosk --> q_kiosk_token: yes, kiosk path
    q_kiosk_token --> q_no_kiosk_config: KIOSK_ACCESS_TOKEN env not set
    q_no_kiosk_config --> [*]: return 500, "Kiosk is not configured"
    q_kiosk_token --> q_validate_kiosk: KIOSK_ACCESS_TOKEN is set
    q_validate_kiosk --> q_kiosk_invalid: token != kioskToken
    q_kiosk_invalid --> [*]: redirect to /dashboard (hide kiosk existence)
    q_validate_kiosk --> q_kiosk_valid: token matches
    q_kiosk_valid --> [*]: NextResponse.next() (allow access)
    q_check_kiosk --> q_check_public: no, not kiosk path
    q_check_public --> q_is_public: pathname starts with /login or /auth/?
    q_is_public --> q_update_session: yes, public path
    q_update_session --> [*]: updateSession(request) for Supabase
    q_is_public --> q_check_oauth: no, protected path
    q_check_oauth --> q_has_oauth: oauth_user_id and oauth_access_token cookies exist?
    q_has_oauth --> q_oauth_valid: yes, both cookies present
    q_oauth_valid --> [*]: NextResponse.next() (allow access)
    q_has_oauth --> q_no_oauth: no, missing cookies
    q_no_oauth --> [*]: redirect to /login

    note right of q_check_kiosk
        INV-001: kiosk access requires query param token matching KIOSK_ACCESS_TOKEN
        INV-002: invalid kiosk token redirects to /dashboard to hide endpoint
        INV-003: protected paths require oauth_user_id + oauth_access_token cookies
        INV-004: /login and /auth/* paths are public (no auth required)
    end note
